invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_tcp.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: the record client's ticket slot is neither zeroed nor emptied, at
  init or later, so the resumption PSK stays in the session after
  take_ticket hands it out and after close, until the memory is
  reused, and a second take_ticket returns it again. Nothing a session
  reports changes.
  loop_record.zig, which requires every byte of the slot to be zero after
  both calls, objects.

--- old
                self.ticket = null;
                std.crypto.secureZero(u8, std.mem.asBytes(&self.ticket));
                std.debug.assert(self.ticket == null);
--- new
                _ = self; // the slot keeps the ticket
